---
import { list } from "~/lib/content";
import Section from "~/components/ui/Section.astro";

const interests = await list("interests");
---

<Section id="about" title="About me" variant="about">
  <div class="about__prose">
    <p>
      I’m a real Rotterdammer, which mostly means I say what I think and skip the formalities. I’m an open
      person and I like bringing out the best in people. Put me in the right setting and I have energy to
      spare. With friends I’m usually the one who plans the outing and chases everyone in the group chat for a
      date. I do the same at work, because someone has to and I quite like being that person.
    </p>
    <p>
      Gaming got me into tech and work got me stuck, though I barely game anymore. What I enjoy most hasn’t
      changed since my first year: digging into a difficult problem until it’s fixed, then making sure people
      have the tools to fix the next one themselves.
    </p>
  </div>
  <ul class="likes" role="list">
    {interests.map((data) => (
      <li class="like" data-lift={data.lift}>
        <span class="like__mark" aria-hidden="true" />
        <span class="like__name">{data.name}</span>
        <span class="like__line">{data.line}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
</Section>

<style>
  @layer components {
    .about__prose {
      max-width: var(--size-measure);
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .about__prose p {
      font-size: var(--text-lead);
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
    }

    .about__prose p:first-child {
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .likes {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem 2.5rem;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
      max-width: 46em;
    }

    @media (width >= 700px) {
      .likes {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }
    }

    /* Each interest lifts a hero print on hover (src/scripts/prints.ts). */
    .like {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 14px 1fr;
      align-items: start;
      gap: 2px 12px;
      min-width: 0;
      cursor: default;
    }

    .like__mark {
      grid-row: 1 / span 2;
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      margin: 0.7em 2px 0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent);
    }

    .like__name {
      grid-column: 2;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: var(--text-h3);
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .like__line {
      grid-column: 2;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      font-size: var(--text-small);
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    @media (hover: hover) {
      .like:hover .like__name {
        color: var(--accent);
      }
    }
  }
</style>
